sentences.text:
In the event of arrest of the petitioner in Crime No.1503/2022 of Ponkunnam Police Station, Kottayam, he shall be produced before the jurisdictional Court on the very same day and shall be released on bail, subject to the following conditions:-
(i) Petitioner shall execute a bond for a sum of Rs.50,000/- (Rupees fifty thousand only) with two .. 4 ..
solvent sureties each for the like-sum to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional court ;
(ii) The petitioner shall appear before the investigating officer in Crime No.1503/2022 of Ponkunnam Police Station, Kottayam, on every Saturday, at 11 am, for a period of one month;
(iii) Petitioner shall appear before the investigating officer in Crime No.1503/2022 of Ponkunnam Police Station, Kottayam as and when summoned to do so;
(iv) The petitioner shall not attempt to (contact the victim or the defacto complainant) or interfere with the investigation or to influence or intimidate any witness in Crime No.1503/2022 of Ponkunnam Police Station, Kottayam;
Thomaskutty vs State Of Kerala on 20 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/68937028/
